# Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.db
backend/static

# Local secrets and VCS. .env.production is not a secret and is included.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.git
**/.cursor
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
